    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Shape Level-Up - Calamity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget idle clickers that only require mindless tapping.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**A hybrid of Clicker, RPG, Strategy, and Story**,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a **galactic-scale growth game** unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Go beyond simple clicking \u2014 use **pattern recognition, skill builds, and equipment combos**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to control the flow of battle and defeat countless bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Click-based combat with additional key inputs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Thousands of possible skill and equipment builds  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 30 boss battles featuring traps, debuffs, and deadly mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original battle BGM powered by Suno AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 This is not a \u201cmindless DPS race.\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can cost everything \u2014 **true strategy is required**.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Genre: Hyper Clicker, Strategy RPG, Survival-Based Growth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Platform: Single Player (PC only)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Languages: Korean / English / Japanese (in progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Shape Level-Up - Calamity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget idle clickers that only require mindless tapping.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**A hybrid of Clicker, RPG, Strategy, and Story**,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a **galactic-scale growth game** unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Go beyond simple clicking \u2014 use **pattern recognition, skill builds, and equipment combos**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to control the flow of battle and defeat countless bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Click-based combat with additional key inputs  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Thousands of possible skill and equipment builds  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 30 boss battles featuring traps, debuffs, and deadly mechanics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original battle BGM powered by Suno AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 This is not a \u201cmindless DPS race.\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can cost everything \u2014 **true strategy is required**.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Genre: Hyper Clicker, Strategy RPG, Survival-Based Growth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Platform: Single Player (PC only)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc Languages: Korean / English / Japanese (in progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
